#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:1 5aa9f1b3a7d14c1383967012beac6d3e
msgid ""
"Run Buildings, Roads and Forest detection in a single Mapflow workflow and "
"get one topology-corrected GeoJSON output."
msgstr "在一个 Mapflow 工作流中同时运行建筑物、道路和森林识别，输出经拓扑校正的统一 GeoJSON。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:7 4985226c50c94eb897da9e2a8f528161
msgid "Buildings + Roads + Forest"
msgstr "建筑物 + 道路 + 森林"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 d5c37daa72d14ffbb92d02e412a6cd2e
msgid ":mf-chip:`road|Roads and base maps` :mf-badge:`Default model`"
msgstr ":mf-chip:`road|道路和底图` :mf-badge:`默认模型`"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst 4e8a2594a8e04cbba036545f58b1fd50
msgid "Buildings, roads and forest layers over a dense urban area"
msgstr "密集城区的建筑物、道路和森林图层"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 39bdb717d22441a9b5fa762bec10ebd7
msgid "Example result: buildings, roads and forest from one run."
msgstr "示例结果：一次运行得到的建筑物、道路和森林。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 2df26b0f9ce14887a1928a155da592de
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "费用"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 4b45226e04f44da3b2c5c3ac15ac05a2
msgid "23 credits per km² + imagery"
msgstr "每 km² 23 积分 + 影像"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 97fcb6615bc243b8b1e4d58e7330c436
msgid "Example: 10 km² on Mapbox zoom 19 ≈ 320 credits."
msgstr "示例：Mapbox 缩放级别 19 下 10 km² ≈ 320 积分。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 8902cbd857b34a08b37e74fa3a1ed4ea
msgid ""
"Runs the Buildings, Roads and Forest models as one workflow and returns a "
"single topology-corrected result, so the layers do not overlap. It costs "
"less than running the three models one by one."
msgstr "将建筑物、道路和森林模型作为一个工作流运行，返回拓扑已校正的单一结果，使各图层互不重叠。费用低于分别运行三个模型。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 c6e4f6e43cc6467c83599729b4a7e054
msgid "What you get"
msgstr "输出结果"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 f182b9708b1b46a1a395846f2fd0c461
msgid "Buildings, roads and forest from one run, as separate styled layers."
msgstr "一次运行得到建筑物、道路和森林，分别输出为带样式的独立图层。"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 f19f2d31dfea46bdb5524d23572c1b4b
msgid "Works best with"
msgstr "最佳适用影像"

#: ../userguides/combo_model.rst:10 b02052ccf5684432b4a7a64ef60f3bfb
